Content upgrade: use a snapshot of the hooks supplied by the versioned loader.
Copy major/minor maps so a later script cannot replace earlier hooks. Explicit
undefined snapshots prevent libraries without an upgrades script from borrowing
another version's hooks. Retain the global fallback for upstream loaders.

